- **[NEW]** flags.n26.com: Real Statsig client SDK key extracted from `app.n26.com/build/js/client.6e429513.js`: `client-OulnFN2GtdJJRAKPLjRLBgckZMUhF5zxtzPGciWbxO0` (SHA256 `0366adb8…`). App Statsig base = `https://flags.n26.com/v1`, env `live`.
- **[CHANGED]** flags.n26.com: `POST /v1/sdk_exception` with `Authorization: Bearer <key>` → `200 {"success":true}` (passes Envoy RBAC). `/v1/initialize`/`/v1/log_event` → Statsig app-layer 401; `/v1/get_configs`/`/v1/evaluate` → 403 RBAC. RBAC is route-specific.
