- **[FINAL]** Statsig client key + multi-route RBAC gap (52) — survives: in-scope MISCONFIG, >40, verify_steps present; impact LOW-MEDIUM (client-scoped key), confirmed real authenticated access to the Statsig fleet via sdk_exception.
- **[FINAL]** GraphQL multi-param/batch smuggling (40) — survives borderline: untried vector on a high-value asset; verify_steps are read-only POSTs against WAF, no mutation. Capped at 40.

